---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" noindex={true} description="How the site handles your data.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB')}</p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      This is a starter template. Before going live, replace it with a full policy reviewed for GDPR/your
      jurisdiction. Below is the outline of what it must cover.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">What we collect</h2>
    <p>Analytics data (pages viewed, approximate location, device) and any details you submit via forms or newsletter sign-up.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Cookies & affiliate tracking</h2>
    <p>We use cookies for analytics and to attribute affiliate referrals. You can control cookies in your browser settings.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR you can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data. Contact <a class="text-brand-400" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-amber-300/70">⚠️ Placeholder — have a lawyer review before publishing.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
